'''Cultists''' are aggressive [[creatures]] found in [[Mountain]]s inside [[Frost Caves]]. Their appearance is distinctly werewolf-like, however, unlike [[Fenring]]s and [[Ulv]]s, they wear tattered red hooded cloaks.

