== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Cultists|Aggressive creature strategies#Cultist}}

=== Fireclaw double ===
The exact same as Fireclaw<ref>The ordering of attacks is based off of how they are ordered in the game files for the sake of data collection.</ref>, but swings a second time with its other hand and has a 10-second cooldown (35 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] 40 [[Damage types#Fire|Fire]] damage each hit). 

=== Fireclaw ===
Swings its claw in a 90-degree horizontal arc that is 3 meters long to scratch the player, which applies the [[Burning]] status (35 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] 40 [[Damage types#Fire|Fire]] damage). This attack has a 2-second cooldown and can be used within 1.5 meters of the player.

=== Flames ===
Brings both arms down before sending out a blast of fire which applies the [[Burning]] status (50 [[Damage types#Fire|Fire]] damage). It hits in a 4-meter 35-degree horizontal arc and can hit through walls. This attack cannot be blocked, has a cooldown of 10 seconds, and can be used 2–6 meters from a player; it cannot be used if the player stands close.

